---

Bundled third-party assets, under their own terms:

* shell/assets/fonts/luxisr.ttf, luxisb.ttf — Luxi Sans (Regular and Bold),
  copyright (c) 2001 Bigelow & Holmes Inc. / URW++ GmbH, redistributed under
  the Luxi fonts license. See shell/assets/fonts/LUXI-LICENSE.txt.

The window-chrome glyphs in shell/src/main.rs (pushpin, menu marks, button
housing, etc.) are traced pixel-for-pixel from Sun Microsystems' OLGlyph
bitmap font (olgl14.bdf), preserved in the historical XView source trees
under Sun's 1989 "permission to use, copy, modify, and distribute ... for
any purpose and without fee" notice. See docs/OPENLOOK-REFERENCE.md.
